Description: Functions for fitting robust longitudinal functional principal
    component regression models for longitudinal scalar-on-function data.
    The package provides tools for simulation-based data generation, robust
    estimation of longitudinal functional principal component decompositions,
    robust mean-surface and covariance estimation, separation of subject-level
    functional intercept, subject-level functional slope, and visit-specific
    deviation components, blockwise estimation of longitudinal functional
    principal component scores, robust additive mixed score regression, and
    coefficient-function reconstruction. The implemented methodology is designed
    for repeatedly observed scalar responses and densely observed functional
    predictors, with resistance to atypical curves, contaminated visits, and
    outlying scalar responses.
